  m_Name: RaskRedhand
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Rask Redhand
  role: 3
  description: 'A Rask field medic, named for the red gauntlets of their trade. The
    Redhand has the Rask Ultima''s health, accuracy and move but lighter armor (10
    health, Armor Level 1, 50% accuracy, 20 m a move) and fights alone (Solo), with
    a Solntse Laser Rifle (the Rask''s Assault Rifle: 6 damage, penetration 1, 20
    m). Its Medkit restores 5 health to a friendly Biological soldier within 5 m,
    such as a wounded Rask rifleman or the Ultima, as its action; it can''t be used
    on one at full health. A Specialist: one per army.'
